@HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249
@username = admin
@password = your_password_here

### Login (Admin)
# @name login
POST {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Staff — danh sách tài khoản (ManageStaff: Admin, Agency Manager)
GET {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff-accounts?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### Staff — danh sách vai trò
GET {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff-accounts/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### Staff — chi tiết tài khoản (đổi userId)
GET {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff-accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### Staff — cập nhật thông tin / khóa tài khoản
PUT {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff-accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "isActive": true
}

###
### Staff — gán vai trò (thay toàn bộ roles hiện tại)
PUT {{HuongVanTra.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff-accounts/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": [ "Sales Staff" ]
}

###
